    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Prepare for spectacular! Mountain Park House is a rare chance to acquire a refurbishment property in #Carlingford a medieval village where outdoorsy meets fireside, where sporty lives alongside relaxed, and all in a village setting of spectacular coastal and mountain beauty. The village is a 10 minute stroll, taking in all of the social amenities that this gorgeous little world has to offer. \n\nAnd to top this, you find Mountain Park House: this villa style dwelling, resting on a c 0.2 acre site, commands fantastic views over Carlingford Lough, taking in Greenore to Warrenpoint in front of you to the east, and Slieve Foye behind you to the west. \n\nThis c 93.5 sq m dwelling, sitting above cellar / storage area, offers 3 bedrooms, living/diner, kitchen, utility / office and bathroom. It also, unusually, has stairs leading to the roof terrace, which offers breathtaking vantage point for this incredible part of the world! \n\nOutside, gardens are to front and side: an especially lovely garden benefitting from mature planting and complete privacy! The property also has small outhouse to front which adds yet another interesting dimension to this delicious opportunity. \n\nThe house, which is ready for complete refurb, has potential to avail of grants, and will give the next owner a wonderful opportunity. \n"
      },
